{"id":62806,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=62806"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:26:26","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:26:26","slug":"adn-race-ponta-do-sol","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/adn-race-ponta-do-sol\/","title":{"rendered":"ADN Race Ponta do Sol 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">ADN Race Ponta do Sol 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>ADN Race Ponta do Sol 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Ponta do Sol<\/strong>, na vertente sul da <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>. Integrando o Campeonato Regional de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira (AARAM) e o Circuito Trail Madeira, o evento convida os atletas a percorrer veredas ancestrais, levadas hist\u00f3ricas (incluindo a Levada Nova e Levada do Moinho) e o vale da ribeira da Ponta do Sol entre a serra e o mar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o divide-se em duas dist\u00e2ncias oficiais: o <strong>Trail Longo (25 km com 1100m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 08:00 na Fonte do Coxo, e o <strong>Trail Sprint (15 km com 800m D+)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 10:00 na promenade da Madalena do Mar. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros de transporte a partir da vila da Ponta do Sol at\u00e9 \u00e0s respetivas zonas de partida, garantindo postos de abastecimento regulares, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica de tempos, apoio m\u00e9dico e medalha oficial de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os finalistas no Largo do Pelourinho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>ADN Ponta do Sol<\/strong>, em parceria institucional com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Madeira (AARAM) e o Munic\u00edpio da Ponta do Sol, assegurando uma prova de elevada qualidade t\u00e9cnica e seguran\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><str